00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,950
Running in a minute.
Three steps, and it works in every project.

2
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:10,100
Check your version.
You need Claude Code 2.1.308 or later.

3
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:17,250
Install the mod.
At a Claude Code prompt.

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:25,400
Open it. Reopen the app or start a new session, then type /tobebestme. The pane opens beside your chat.

